# Database migrations are applied by hand in the Supabase SQL Editor and kept
# out of the repository. Keep a backup somewhere private: excluded from git
# means excluded from history, so a lost working copy is a lost schema.
#
# The leading slash anchors this to the repo root. Without it the pattern also
# matched src/lib/supabase/ - the client helpers 35 files import - which broke
# the Vercel build with "Can't resolve '@/lib/supabase/client'".
/supabase/

